    "stubs": [],
    "tables": {"external_api_call_counts": {"order": ["api", "day"]}}
  },
  "_doc_pwa_sheet": "pwa_sheet*: stub google (google_stub.py: OAuth token, Sheets API, Firestore REST reads; a throwaway service-account key). compare_sheets = the spreadsheets each worker left in the stub are compared cell by cell too. CHECK_OFFSET_MIN 1440 = every check's snapshot time has passed (hours 9, 13, 17); -1440 = none yet (the 06:05 run: the tab is only created). log_ignore: urllib3 retry warnings of google-auth's background regional-access-boundary lookup (iamcredentials.googleapis.com), which the dead HTTPS proxy refuses: Python only.",
  "pwa_sheet": {
    "env": {"PWA_SHEET_ID": "pwa-create", "CHECK_OFFSET_MIN": "1440"},
